@startuml C3_Generate_Operation_Plans_Physical_View
title C3 - Plan Generation (Physical / Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "User Device\n(Browser)" as Client {
  artifact "Angular SPA"
}

node "OEM API Server\n(Node.js / NestJS)" as OemServer {
  artifact "OperationPlanController"
  artifact "OperationPlanService"
}

database "OEM Database" as OemDb

node "TodoApi Server" as TodoApi {
  artifact "VVN Catalog API"
}

node "Resource APIs" as ResourceApis {
  artifact "Resources API"
  artifact "Staff API"
  artifact "Storage Areas API"
}

node "Identity Provider" as Identity {
  artifact "OAuth 2.0 / OIDC"
}

Operator --> Client : HTTPS UI access
Client --> OemServer : REST calls (preview/generate)
OemServer --> OemDb : Persist plans + tasks
OemServer --> TodoApi : Fetch approved VVNs
OemServer --> ResourceApis : Fetch cranes/staff/storage
Client --> Identity : Authentication flow
OemServer --> Identity : Validate token / roles

@enduml
